{"pageid": 751, "title": "Gail", "revid": 1656, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Females", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Gail</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215170618\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Gail8\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170618\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170618 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215170618 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Gail8\" width=\"270\" height=\"466\" data-image-key=\"Gail8.png\" data-image-name=\"Gail8.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Secretary<br />Receptionist</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> Police Department</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed father †<br /><p><span class=\"new\" title=\"David (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGF2aWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">David</span> <small>(partner/husband)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> <small>(adoptive daughter)</small><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">I was there when my father passed, and it wasn't scary. It was peaceful. He had been in a lot of pain, and then he was at rest. And ever since then, I've known he's been in Heaven looking down on me.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Gail , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #8</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Gail</b> is an elderly woman who worked as a secretary and receptionist at the <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> police department, and later became the adoptive mother of <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> following the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Gail worked at the <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> Police Department as a receptionist or secretary. She had a partner named <span class=\"new\" title=\"David (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGF2aWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">David</span> who used to keep her awake snoring until he got a CPAP; she would use cremes to help her sleep.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> At some point, she was present for the death of her father. As he had been in a lot of pain, she saw his death as peaceful and a way for him to rest.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC8&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC8-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>During the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>, Gail was put in charge of watching <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> while the police investigated and identified the bodies she was found with. Gail was very sweet and kindly to her, though slightly thrown by her morbidity. She offered <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> coffee and allowed her to say, as Bian knew and recognized her.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> When Erica returned with <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">Officer Richards</a> threatened them, Gail attempted to call <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">the Sheriff</a>, only for Aaron to knock her out.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC8&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC8-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Gail would later take in Bian after the girl's family failed to pick her up.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Gail is an older Caucasian woman with white hair. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span></h2>\n<p>Gail is very sweet, kindly and patient, but does not take nonsense lightly. She is unafraid of death, but even still is thrown by Bian's more direct questions about it. She also appears to be religious.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"582bbe1a5ad8afa888bf0f694e3f5f0c\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Gail8-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:107px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Gail8.png\" title=\"Gail8.png (611 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:107px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/107?cb=20241215170618\" title=\"Gail8.png (611 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #8\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Gail8.png\" data-image-key=\"Gail8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Gail8.png (611 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #8\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Gail8.png\" data-image-key=\"Gail8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/29/Gail8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/107?cb=20241215170618\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC6_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC6_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC6_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_C